cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "EFAX: Exponential Families in JAX"
abstract: >-
  EFAX provides tools for working with exponential family distributions in JAX, including the
  natural and expectation parametrizations of each family and a uniform interface to efficient
  implementations of the functions that relate them.
